{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/476435-a-wholesale-kidnapping-how","id":476435,"title":"A wholesale kidnapping: how?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-10T17:14:14-07:00","id":476435,"title":"A wholesale kidnapping: how?","content":"One of the Gentry decides that he needs a large number of teenage girls to populate and decorate some portion of his realm, so he decides to kidnap a bunch of them all at once. One big swoop. As getting them is part of the fun, he decides to maximize the challenge by kidnapping them while they're all naked. So, how might he go about doing this? Any girls he considers insufficiently pretty will be reshaped in Arcadia, probably painfully, so he doesn't have to try to filter outer girls on basis of looks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T18:46:06-07:00","id":476488,"title":"","content":"By his subtle manipulation he convinces a group of teens at a summer camp to all go skinny dipping at midnight. The adults, councilors or people of authority are influenced to not notice and be unable to prevent or stop this plan. Even those who never would do such a thing cave to the peer pressure with the fey's subtle touch.<br /> <br /> My idea of how would be easiest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T20:30:03-07:00","id":476562,"title":"","content":"Three words: convenient natural disaster.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T20:50:22-07:00","id":476576,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.F.I.X.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/476435-a-wholesale-kidnapping-how?p=476488#post476488\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">By his subtle manipulation he convinces a group of teens at a summer camp to all go skinny dipping at midnight. The adults, councilors or people of authority are influenced to not notice and be unable to prevent or stop this plan. Even those who never would do such a thing cave to the peer pressure with the fey's subtle touch.<br /> <br /> My idea of how would be easiest.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Then send a band of water trolls to drag them under the lake where they've opened a path to the hedge!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T21:01:22-07:00","id":476602,"title":"","content":"Or just take advantage of the &quot;reflective surface&quot; rule and turn the surface of the lake into a hedge gate when the moon's at the right elevation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T21:18:07-07:00","id":476615,"title":"","content":"He could just grab them out of a locker room. But it might be just as easy for him to kidnap a bunch of random people at once and turn them into teenage girls once he gets back home.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T21:28:10-07:00","id":476621,"title":"","content":"But that's part of the challenge: finding a way to get just teenage girls. Remember, the Gentry are big on self-imposed challenges.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T21:52:13-07:00","id":476629,"title":"","content":"Locker room, cheerleader or any athletic high school girl's team trip, cheerleader camp, sorority house, sorority trip, free tickets to see boy band, tryouts to join girl group, auditions for fake reality tv show.<br /> <br /> I think I've seen movies or read stories with most of these. Obviously private girls school. I suppose there's more male cheerleaders now. And obviously the boy band is likely to bring all sorts of people.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 04-11-2015, 12:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T21:57:59-07:00","id":476631,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/476435-a-wholesale-kidnapping-how?p=476615#post476615\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He could just grab them out of a locker room. But it might be just as easy for him to kidnap a bunch of random people at once and turn them into teenage girls once he gets back home.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> That's just what we need... Ivankov, the True Fae.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T22:01:05-07:00","id":476632,"title":"","content":"If he didn't need to get them all at once I was thinking of a True Fae being asked to take a seat by Chris Hansen, with all those timeless days spent kidnapping people who knew how to use computers and turning them into online privateers for naught.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T00:23:45-07:00","id":476738,"title":"","content":"<b>Funny idea:</b> While they're all skinny dipping, the Gentry shows up in a fishing boat and reels them in with his net! Would make for a grand fisherman's tale when he gets back home.<br /> <br /> Then he turns them into mermaids. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T07:30:18-07:00","id":476934,"title":"","content":"Does it need to a be an already existing group of girls? A True Fae could easily just grab every teenage girl in a town (even a country) that meets the conditions, either via minions or some ritual effect. Simultaneously, even, from multiple bedrooms, bathrooms, etc.<br /> <br /> If this is just for backstory, I wouldn't worry too much about it. &quot;A wizard did it&quot; can apply to 90% of Gentry actions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4722,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4722-birnam","user":"Birnam","date":". 04-12-2015, 11:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4722-birnam","name":"Birnam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4722_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T10:48:57-07:00","id":477082,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/476435-a-wholesale-kidnapping-how?p=476738#post476738\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Funny idea:</b> While they're all skinny dipping, the Gentry shows up in a fishing boat and reels them in with his net! Would make for a grand fisherman's tale when he gets back home.<br /> <br /> Then he turns them into mermaids. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Got a whale of a tale to tell you, lads, a whale of a tale or two.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T00:00:48-07:00","id":482059,"title":"","content":"&quot;Spring Break&quot; would work really well with this. Drunk, fun seeking Teen &amp; College Girls? Beach parties? Yeah, the Gentry is going to have a ball.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>&quot;I am a daydreamer and a Night thinker.&quot;~</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1820-nightout","name":"Nightout","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1820_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T00:03:40-07:00","id":482061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nightout</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/476435-a-wholesale-kidnapping-how?p=482059#post482059\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Spring Break&quot; would work really well with this. Drunk, fun seeking Teen &amp; College Girls? Beach parties? Yeah, the Gentry is going to have a ball.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Better yet, he turns into a beach ball. Any teenage girls who play with him get transported to Arcadia!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T09:58:50-07:00","id":482487,"title":"","content":"I have to say I'm not really feeling the ideas here.<br /> <br /> If the gentry wants a challenge, we need to decide what limitations it imposes upon itself. Simply saying they all have to be naked at the same time isn't sufficient since an un-self-limited Gentry is nearly infinitely powerful it could just wait for any reason a group of teenage girls would simultaneously be naked and teleport them to Arcadia with a thought.<br /> <br /> Now a Gentry having to convince an entire group of girls to do something while naked with only an ordinary teenage girls body and social skills; no magic until after they've stripped off, then it's free to think them to Arcadia. That's a self imposed challenge.<br /> <br /> Having to capture the girls and shove them in an infinitely large bag with nothing but mundane muscles (but a fair amount of them, strength 5 on horseback, or a strength 5 mermaid) is a self imposed challenge.<br /> <br /> But &quot;they have to be naked&quot; isn't a challenge. Because using it's god-tier mind control to make them strip off, and then it's god tier teleportation powers to capture them, is easy.<br /> <br /> Basically. Decide what powers the Gentry gets to use first, then choose how it abducts people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 04-16-2015, 01:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}